    "name":  "LED Controller 2-in-1 Single Color + CCT - 2.4 GHz RF",
    "reference":  "FL7374-E2-RF",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e2-in-1 LED Controller (2.4 GHz)\u003c/strong\u003e is a versatile and easy-to-use device that allows tool-free installation and efficient remote control with Mi-Light/MiBoxer series remotes. With a 30-meter range, it offers brightness and color temperature adjustments, and the ability to switch between single-color and dual-white modes via a button, ideal for customizing and adapting lighting to various needs.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Controller 2-in-1 Single Color + CCT - 2.4 GHz RF\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 2-in-1 LED Controller (2.4 GHz) is an advanced versatile solution for LED lighting control.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstant Tool-Free Wiring:\u003c/strong\u003e Quick easy installation without tools.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMi-Light/MiBoxer 2.4 GHz Remote Compatibility:\u003c/strong\u003e Efficient reliable remote control.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e30m Control Distance:\u003c/strong\u003e Flexibility across multiple locations.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdjustable Brightness and Color Temperature:\u003c/strong\u003e Personalized lighting ambient.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOutput Mode Switching:\u003c/strong\u003e Button to toggle between single color and dual white modes.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIdeal for adaptable easy-to-use lighting solutions in residential or commercial settings.\u003c/p\u003e",
